# Letting go of a car and grabbing it again is not a new trick in the same combo: a 2.7 s skitch,
# let go, grab again within the landing grace (4 ticks later): the first Skitch banks (510) before
# the second starts, which banks on its own (295). (They used to link, Skitch + Skitch, so grabbing
# on and off paid a multiplier for nothing.)
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 seed 7
cmd 0 teleport -62.3 -322 2.31 0
cmd 1 car -51.1 -331.2 356 7
cmd 60 teleport -49.44 -330.22 2.11 355.2
cmd 66 set skater.vel.x -0.58
cmd 66 set skater.vel.y 6.97
hold grab 72..400
hold grab 404..560
run 700
expect event skitchEnd{reason=let go,points=510} within 400..402
expect event comboLanded{name=Skitch,points=510,multiplier=1} within 404..406
expect event skitchStart within 404..406
expect event skitchEnd{reason=let go,points=295} within 560..562
expect event comboLanded{name=Skitch,points=295,multiplier=1} within 570..574
expect no event bail
